## ▶️ How to Run the Project

### Step 1: Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/Single-Port-RAM.git
```

### Step 2: Navigate to the Project Directory

```bash
cd Single-Port-RAM
```

### Step 3: Open Xilinx Vivado

Launch Vivado and create a new RTL project.

### Step 4: Add Design Source

Add the following file as a design source:

```text
ram.v
```

### Step 5: Add Testbench

Add the following file as a simulation source:

```text
self_tb.v
```

### Step 6: Run Behavioral Simulation

Navigate to:

```text
Flow Navigator → Simulation → Run Simulation → Run Behavioral Simulation
```

### Step 7: Run Complete Simulation

Vivado may initially stop at 1000 ns.

To execute the complete testbench, enter the following command in the Tcl Console:

```tcl
run all
```

### Step 8: Verify Results

Check the simulation console for the final PASS message.

The expected simulation completion time is 1870 ns.

